  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In Bai Ning Bing’s use the Gu’s insignia is a six sided ice flower symbol on the tongue. She injects primeval essence into the tongue, puffs her cheeks, and exhales light blue icy wind. Against Tie Dao Ku that wind covers his arms and half his chest in frost and slows his attacks. She uses it to break his close range pressure and open space for Icicle Gu and snowball Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          298
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "bai-ning-bings-battle-stage-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_bai_ning_bing",
          "char_tie_dao_ku",
          "gu_icicle_gu",
          "gu_snowball_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Against Yan Tu she pairs frost breath Gu with frost arrow Gu to slow fiery snakes, then in ice crystal form breathes blue frost that shrinks a fiery snake; that frost aura is higher level than her mortal form breath.",
        "chapters": [
          313
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "bai-ning-bings-battle-stage-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_yan_tu",
          "gu_frost_arrow_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "With mortal flesh she can only activate Frost Breath Gu in intervals to keep her mouth and tongue from freezing. After Ice Crystal Gu turns her body to ice crystal, she can breathe frost continuously. She feeds that continuous frost into tornado Gu’s whirlwind for her improved ice blade storm killer move. Continuous frost breath also densifies the tornado until she cannot move it forward. She later freezes fiery claws with a furious Frost Breath Gu activation during that same match.",
        "chapters": [
          314
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "bai-ning-bings-battle-stage-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_ice_crystal_gu",
          "gu_tornado_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Yan tribe Gu Masters try to break out against Fang Yuan’s wolf group, frost breath Gu is among the Gu they activate; narration shows blue frost breath breathed out with fire, snow, and other attacks.",
        "chapters": [
          472
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "other-users",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_yan_tribe",
          "fac_gu_masters"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
